- Package: https://www.nuget.org/packages/MOGWAI

Description:
MOGWAI is an embeddable, stack-based RPN (Reverse Polish Notation) scripting
engine for .NET, with 354 built-in primitives (math, strings, lists, files,
HTTP, and more). Inspired by HP calculators (HP 28S, HP 48), it brings the
elegance of RPN to modern .NET applications.

History:
Originally created in 2015 as a Bluetooth Low Energy peripheral simulator for
mobile app testing, MOGWAI evolved over the following decade into a
general-purpose embeddable scripting language with an extensive library of
built-in primitives covering strings, regular expressions, math, HTTP, UDP,
object-oriented programming, and more.

